cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CausEval in research, please cite it."
title: "CausEval: Causal Rule Coverage for AI Behavioral Contracts"
type: software
version: 0.1.1
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/aravinda-1402/causeval"
authors:
  - family-names: "Jatavallabha"
    given-names: "Aravinda Raman"
    alias: "aravinda-1402"
abstract: >-
  A tool that extracts behavioral rules from an AI system prompt, maps them to an
  existing evaluation suite, removes one rule at a time, and measures whether the
  mapped evaluations detect the removal. It reports Trace Coverage and Causal Rule
  Coverage as evidence about behavioral regression protection under one tested
  model and configuration, together with the confounds that evidence cannot rule
  out. It makes no claim of correctness, safety or compliance.
keywords:
  - large language models
  - evaluation
  - mutation testing
  - prompt engineering
  - software testing
